[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"114937","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"401899","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"54783","synopsis":"Tamako move to her uncle's house in Kobe to begin her studies in medicine. Later that day, Tamahiko and Yuzuki go shopping at the village market where they draw the attention of young Ryo Atsumi. At night, Yuzuki gives Tamahiko a birthday present.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lWuDZ46LmOM8qnlGeVatmg95whT.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Tamako move to her uncle's house in Kobe to begin her studies in medicine. Later that day, Tamahiko and Yuzuki go shopping at the village market where they draw the attention of young Ryo Atsumi. At night, Yuzuki gives Tamahiko a birthday present.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lWuDZ46LmOM8qnlGeVatmg95whT.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15938","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"127412","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"45055","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"114937","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"401899","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"54875","synopsis":"Tamahiko tracks Ryo down to her home, only to discover that she is the oldest of  three younger siblings and her theft is due to the fact that her father is an abusive alcoholic. The next day, Tamahiko returns to Ryo's home to try to retrieve the bookmark she stole from him and Ryo agrees to return it if Tamahiko helps her younger siblings with their school homework.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f3zWAzBTshfXw6vPrTtzNnYbsSm.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Tamahiko tracks Ryo down to her home, only to discover that she is the oldest of  three younger siblings and her theft is due to the fact that her father is an abusive alcoholic. The next day, Tamahiko returns to Ryo's home to try to retrieve the bookmark she stole from him and Ryo agrees to return it if Tamahiko helps her younger siblings with their school homework.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f3zWAzBTshfXw6vPrTtzNnYbsSm.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15938","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"127412","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"45055","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"114937","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"401899","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"55116","synopsis":"Ryo's siblings and other kids from the village approach Tamahiko asking him to tutor them again. While Tamahiko is in the middle of a lesson, Ryo appears, who, with the excuse of cooking something for the kids, takes Yuzuki to the kitchen to have a conversation. Inspired by the tutoring, Tamahiko writes to his father asking to be allowed to return to school. Later, Ryotaro reveals that he is undecided about an offer received.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ldDuMrmeYPVtv944ufy65GR2HS4.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Ryo's siblings and other kids from the village approach Tamahiko asking him to tutor them again. While Tamahiko is in the middle of a lesson, Ryo appears, who, with the excuse of cooking something for the kids, takes Yuzuki to the kitchen to have a conversation. Inspired by the tutoring, Tamahiko writes to his father asking to be allowed to return to school. Later, Ryotaro reveals that he is undecided about an offer received.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ldDuMrmeYPVtv944ufy65GR2HS4.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15938","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"127412","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"45055","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"114937","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"401899","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"55341","synopsis":"Tamako finds out that Tamahiko wants to go back to school, so she puts him in touch with his uncle Tamasuke, who decides to help him. Meanwhile, Yuzuki learns about her favorite singer Kotori Shiratori coming to town for a performance, so Tamahiko decides to take a break from his studies for the remedial exam to go with Yuzuki and the local kids.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rXWm0cnrOhKnmBMOy2WF3thFv0h.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Tamako finds out that Tamahiko wants to go back to school, so she puts him in touch with his uncle Tamasuke, who decides to help him. Meanwhile, Yuzuki learns about her favorite singer Kotori Shiratori coming to town for a performance, so Tamahiko decides to take a break from his studies for the remedial exam to go with Yuzuki and the local kids.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rXWm0cnrOhKnmBMOy2WF3thFv0h.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15938","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"127412","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"45055","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"114937","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"401899","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"55522","synopsis":"The famous singer Kotori and his brother Hakaru arrive at Tamahiko's villa. Kotori tells Yuzuki that she is working on a new song, but that she needs some advice about love to better communicate the message. Kotori also talks about how Hakaru used to love playing and singing music, but he had to give up after falling ill.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2UPU8QzTxjhyy6VEIXmqf8Lwxly.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"The famous singer Kotori and his brother Hakaru arrive at Tamahiko's villa. Kotori tells Yuzuki that she is working on a new song, but that she needs some advice about love to better communicate the message. Kotori also talks about how Hakaru used to love playing and singing music, but he had to give up after falling ill.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2UPU8QzTxjhyy6VEIXmqf8Lwxly.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15938","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"127412","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"45055","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"114937","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"401899","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"55648","synopsis":"Yuzuki receives a letter from her old friend and classmate, Midori, announcing that she is pregnant and getting married. Since they may not get a chance to meet again, Midori ask Yuzuki to pay her a visit. Yuzuki finally decides to go to Tokyo to meet Midori, tasking Ryo with looking after Tamahiko.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zJgunY0UEFHBQLcK5jbemvH5rsL.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"Yuzuki receives a letter from her old friend and classmate, Midori, announcing that she is pregnant and getting married. Since they may not get a chance to meet again, Midori ask Yuzuki to pay her a visit. Yuzuki finally decides to go to Tokyo to meet Midori, tasking Ryo with looking after Tamahiko.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zJgunY0UEFHBQLcK5jbemvH5rsL.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15938","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"127412","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"45055","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"114937","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"401899","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"55755","synopsis":"Tamahiko, worried about Yuzuki, decides to go to Tokyo. Ryo accompanies him, as she is also worried about her brother Ryotaro. The road is long since they cannot use the train. As they approach Tokyo, the effects of the earthquake become more apparent. In Tokyo, they met Tamako, who is helping the people affected by the earthquake. With no news from Tamako, Tamahiko searches the ruins of Tokyo for the missing Yuzuki.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kmfCKV4oFjj7A9TyFfkZ4mEgJ5k.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"Tamahiko, worried about Yuzuki, decides to go to Tokyo. Ryo accompanies him, as she is also worried about her brother Ryotaro. The road is long since they cannot use the train. As they approach Tokyo, the effects of the earthquake become more apparent. In Tokyo, they met Tamako, who is helping the people affected by the earthquake. With no news from Tamako, Tamahiko searches the ruins of Tokyo for the missing Yuzuki.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kmfCKV4oFjj7A9TyFfkZ4mEgJ5k.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeN